README.md

Dokumentasi/checklist pendamping.

Total target: 38 artefak source code, test, konfigurasi, dan dokumentasi.

Lampiran B — Perintah Quality Gate
Lokasi: terminal pada root repository kantin-multi-tenant.

php artisan optimize:clear
php artisan migrate:fresh --seed --env=testing
php artisan test --testsuite=Feature --stop-on-failure
./vendor/bin/pint --test
npm run build

Gunakan database testing terpisah; `migrate:fresh` menghapus seluruh tabel target.
Jalankan integration/concurrency test pada MariaDB, bukan hanya SQLite memory.
Untuk parallel testing, pasang Paratest dan segmentasikan Redis/external resources per process [S5].
Simpan hasil quality gate sebagai evidence release, bukan sebagai pengganti review kode.
Lampiran C — Referensi Resmi
Perintah dan asumsi versi pada buku ini diverifikasi terhadap dokumentasi resmi yang diakses 2 Agustus 2026. Dokumentasi API, library, platform web, tooling pengujian, dan komponen operasi non-Laravel telah dipetakan ke kebutuhan SRS. Kontrak provider/kanal final wajib ditetapkan melalui ADR sebelum dependensi dikunci.

[S1] Laravel 13.x Release Notes — minimum PHP 8.3 — https://laravel.com/docs/13.x/releases
[S2] Laravel 13.x Installation — Laravel installer, Vite, dan composer run dev — https://laravel.com/docs/13.x/installation
[S3] Livewire 4 Installation — Composer install dan package auto-discovery — https://livewire.laravel.com/docs/4.x/installation
[S4] Laravel 13.x Reverb — install:broadcasting dan reverb:start — https://laravel.com/docs/13.x/reverb
[S5] Laravel 13.x Testing — PHPUnit/Pest dan parallel testing — https://laravel.com/docs/13.x/testing
[S6] MariaDB InnoDB Introduction — ACID dan workload transactional — https://mariadb.com/docs/server/server-usage/storage-engines/innodb/innodb-storage-engine-introduction
[S7] Laravel 13.x Query Builder — lockForUpdate dalam transaksi — https://laravel.com/docs/13.x/queries
[S8] Laravel 13.x Queues — dispatch after commit — https://laravel.com/docs/13.x/queues
